      "text": "A long exact sequence for symplectic Floer cohomology — 17 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Dehn twists, and all that\n\n**A long exact sequence for symplectic Floer cohomology**\n\n*Paul Seidel*\n\n71 pp, 17 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; 1 Dehn twists, and all that; 1.1 Exact symplectic geometry and fibrations; 1.2 The local model; 1.3 Vanishing cycles; 2 Pseudo-holomorphic sections; 2.1 A simple invariant; 2.2 Horizontality; 2.3 A vanishing theorem; 2.4 Relative invariants; 2.5 Horizontality and relative invariants; 3 Wrapping it up; 3.1 Preliminaries; 3.2 The first map; 3.3 The second map; 3.4 The homotopy",
